# Mod Editor / game-generated artifacts (if the game writes into the mod folder)
*.log
ModContent.hpk
Previews/

# tools/ is importable, so anything that imports doccheck leaves bytecode here
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# .claude/ is local scratch and never committed -- except the skills, which are
# project material both vendors load (mirrored to .agents/skills/ by --regen).
# .agents/skills/ is the GENERATED byte mirror of .claude/skills/ for Codex --
# doccheck reds on drift; regenerate, never hand-edit.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

# The train modules' textures (brief 34, 2026-10-02; formerly the two dev mods'): the Mod Editor
# copies them in as DDS on every import (~100 MB raw), from SMR-Assets' pipelines. They SHIP (the
# packer reads the folder) but are never committed; upload_preflight.py checks each is used.
/Textures/
/Fallbacks/

# Agent/subagent working space: write freely, never committed, never cited.
# The eviction prompt sweeps files older than 14 days (STATE_EVICTION.md).
scratch/*
!scratch/README.md

# Durable in-tree material that must not ship or be committed (large
# binaries, logs, evidence a report links to). Never swept, unlike scratch/
# above. Owner decision, 2026-09-21 (local/README.md is the entry gate),
# ported from the fix pack the same day.
local/*
!local/README.md
